  - m_Id: 2127812507983872
    m_Localized: Welcome!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127905697030144
    m_Localized: This tutorial introduces the fundamental concepts of the game 'Beaks
      and Bullets'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2128865894850560
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2141605329887232
    m_Localized: 'Tap a bird to shoot it down. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2144199943118848
    m_Localized: The target bird's name will be shown here. Try to shoot down the
      correct bird for now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146615597981696
    m_Localized: Shoot down the correct bird!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2152327342448640
    m_Localized: If you miss your shot, you will loose ammunition. You have 12 bullets
      in total.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2152366643077120
    m_Localized: 'If you kill the wrong bird, you will loose one hearth. In total
      you have three health points. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2155337355354112
    m_Localized: Tutorial finished
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2155396776058880
    m_Localized: You have finished the tutorial and are ready for the main game.
      Good Luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
